# Client UI conventions

- Direction is **simplification**: the MVP UI exposes only model slot selection, input device,
  pitch, and an on/off toggle. When touching UI, prefer removing options over adding them.
- Server device mode is the default audio path; client (browser) audio mode is legacy for us —
  do not invest in improving it.
- Do not add new npm dependencies for things achievable with existing ones; the client will be
  wrapped in a desktop shell (pywebview/Tauri), keep it free of browser-only assumptions where
  practical.
- UI text visible to end users: English for now (localization is out of scope for Phase 1).
